{"id":"english-g7a","subject":"english","grade":7,"term":"上","title":"人教版初中英语七年级上册","units":[{"no":1,"id":"english-g7a-u1","title":"词法基础","questions":[{"t":"choice","o":["a","an","the","/"],"a":1,"q":"There is ___ apple on the table.","kp":"名词与冠词","ex":"apple 以元音音素开头。","id":"9029e467cb"},{"t":"choice","o":["box","boxs","boxes","boxies"],"a":2,"q":"I have three ___.","kp":"名词与冠词","ex":"以 x 结尾加 -es。","id":"0d796714d9"},{"t":"choice","o":["I","me","my","mine"],"a":3,"q":"This book is ___. (我的)","kp":"代词与数词","ex":"名词性物主代词单独使用。","id":"7ee86364c1"},{"t":"tf","a":true,"q":"“它的”用 its，“它是”用 it's。","kp":"代词与数词","ex":"两者区别。","id":"5267851b06"},{"t":"choice","o":["a","an","the","/"],"a":1,"q":"He is ___ honest boy.","kp":"名词与冠词","ex":"honest 中 h 不发音，以元音音素开头。","id":"78877e4fd6"},{"t":"choice","o":["I","me","my","mine"],"a":1,"q":"Give ___ the book, please. (我)","kp":"代词与数词","ex":"作宾语用宾格。","id":"8a591948ef"},{"t":"tf","a":true,"q":"不可数名词没有复数形式。","kp":"名词与冠词","ex":"如 water。","id":"9ff811e4df"},{"t":"choice","o":["twelve","twelveth","the twelve","twelfth"],"a":0,"q":"There are ___ students in the room.","kp":"代词与数词","ex":"基数词表示数量。","id":"e0292411be"}]},{"no":2,"id":"english-g7a-u2","title":"时态与基本句型","questions":[{"t":"choice","o":["go","goes","going","went"],"a":1,"q":"She ___ to school every day.","kp":"一般现在时","ex":"第三人称单数加 -es。","id":"b14789e60e"},{"t":"choice","o":["plays","play","playing","played"],"a":1,"q":"They ___ football on Sundays.","kp":"一般现在时","ex":"主语为复数用原形。","id":"5721113825"},{"t":"choice","o":["is","are","be","have"],"a":0,"q":"There ___ some milk in the glass.","kp":"There be 与疑问句","ex":"milk 不可数，用 is。","id":"2a78aefbdd"},{"t":"tf","a":true,"q":"There be 句型中 be 动词与最近的名词保持一致。","kp":"There be 与疑问句","ex":"就近原则。","id":"261cbe8b57"},{"t":"choice","o":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"a":1,"q":"___ he often play basketball?","kp":"一般现在时","ex":"第三人称单数用 Does。","id":"3a98ed4932"},{"t":"choice","o":["Yes, there are.","Yes, they are.","Yes, there is.","No, there is."],"a":0,"q":"Are there any books on the desk? — ___","kp":"There be 与疑问句","ex":"回答与问句一致。","id":"7f8f7d2f28"},{"t":"tf","a":true,"q":"一般现在时可表示客观事实。","kp":"一般现在时","ex":"如 The sun rises in the east.","id":"d1b86f06aa"},{"t":"tf","a":true,"q":"一般疑问句的语序是把 be 动词或助动词提前。","kp":"There be 与疑问句","ex":"疑问句语序。","id":"7c92ff9dbc"}]}]}